<h1>Chad Koppie</h1>
<p>US House, 7th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican.</p>
<p><a href="https://chadkoppie.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (chadkoppie.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Koppie&#39;s campaign site summarizes his platform as &quot;Life, Liberty, Limited Government&quot; and says the principle of limited government is vital to restoring America. His issues page says the national debt and deficit prevent economic growth, that the federal government has no constitutional authority over public education, and that the traditional family unit must be restored. He also lists free-market health care, control over immigration as a matter of sovereignty, and abolishing the Federal Reserve and the IRS.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Retired Delta Airlines jumbo jet captain and lifelong farmer who serves on the Kane County Regional Board of Schools and previously was a township trustee and local school board member.</p>
